# Image markers (reference/components/list.md#image-markers). Pages of 595 × 300 with margins of 40: page area of
# 515 × 220 from (40, 40), which ends at y = 260. Lines of 12 (Size 10), baseline 9 below the top of the line and
# capitals of 0.7 × 10 = 7, so an image is centered 3.5 above the baseline: 5.5 below the top of the line.
#
# The indent of the lists is their left Padding of 20, declared in Styles. The image is as tall as the Size (10)
# unless it declares Height, as wide as its proportion gives (check.svg and cross.svg are square; shapes.svg is
# 200 × 100) and followed by a space of 5 pt, so the square ones measure 15 and start at x = 45.
# i1 takes the image of the list; i2 replaces it with cross.svg of Height 14 (19 wide, at x = 41, centered on the
# capitals: its top is 1.5 above the item); i3 starts with a nested list with dashes, whose first line is shared.
# The block fill ends exactly at the end of the page; second starts on page 2 with its marker on the first line: the
# wide shapes.svg (20 + 5) needs an indent of its own, 40, and its items start at x = 80.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: es
	Title: Prueba
	Page:
		Width: 595
		Height: 300
		Margin: 40
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Size: 10
		For element: List
			Box:
				Padding: 0 0 0 20
	Section:
		List:
			Id: icons
			Marker: image
			Marker image: test/check.svg
				Alt: Incluido
			List item:
				Id: i1
				Text: Responsabilidad civil
			List item:
				Id: i2
				Marker image: test/cross.svg
					Alt: Excluido
					Height: 14
				Text: Daños propios
			List item:
				Id: i3
				List:
					Id: sub
					Marker: dash
					List item:
						Id: sa
						Text: Asistencia en viaje
		Block:
			Id: fill
			Box:
				Height: 184
				Background: #F1EFE8
		List:
			Id: second
			Marker: image
			Marker image: test/shapes.svg
			Box:
				Padding: 0 0 0 40
			List item:
				Id: s1
				Text: Paisaje
